      "description": "Integrates with external fraud intelligence APIs and services to assess risk, detect fraud patterns, and aggregate risk scores. Supports multiple authentication methods (API Keys, OAuth 2.0, Basic Auth, custom headers), real-time transaction analysis, batch processing, user/account verification, and webhook integrations. Normalizes responses to a standard fraud risk schema and can combine scores from multiple APIs using weighted aggregation.",
